    "title": "Unheard and disappointed: students react to the renaming of the Diversity Lounge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Samantha Haney ,\n1 days ago The Trump Administration has been threating and taking funds away from universities and colleges around the nation if they do not rename or completely remove Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) offices, initiatives, and speech. For a period, students at private universities, such as Drury University, were under the assumption that the threat of funding would not impact them. This assumption arose from an understanding that private universities do not rely heavily on federal funding, but rather on private investments and donations. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
